    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract interface for collecting anonymous runtime performance facts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Implement this interface and wire it via <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1updates_1_1_hardware_telemetry_reporter_1aeb6d9c18abda749b404ca42f901e4c40" kindref="member">HardwareTelemetryReporter::setPerformanceProvider()</ref></computeroutput> to include performance data in telemetry reports. All returned values must be coarse/bucketed – the interface contract forbids returning query text, table names, or any user-identifiable data. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
